import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 456 | Dragon Ball · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Stamp Out Combat-Power Inflation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 456 | Dragon Ball · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Stamp Out Combat-Power Inflation","no":456,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Alaya","Supervision","Combat-Power Inflation","Institutional Design"],"related":["21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0456_模块2-龙珠-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝战力膨胀的制度设计.md","filePath":"en/0456_模块2-龙珠-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝战力膨胀的制度设计.md"}'),n={name:"en/0456_模块2-龙珠-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝战力膨胀的制度设计.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,h){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-456-dragon-ball-·-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-stamp-out-combat-power-inflation" tabindex="-1">Entry 456 | Dragon Ball · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Stamp Out Combat-Power Inflation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-456-dragon-ball-·-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-stamp-out-combat-power-inflation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 456 | Dragon Ball · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Stamp Out Combat-Power Inflation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 25 · Alternative 5) | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 27, 49</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-install-a-brake-on-numerical-inflation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: install a brake on numerical inflation <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-install-a-brake-on-numerical-inflation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: install a brake on numerical inflation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s combat-power inflation is essentially &quot;no brake&quot; — numbers from hundreds to ∞, transformation layers from 1 to 8+, revival rules from &quot;one wish a year&quot; to &quot;revive whenever.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: any energy change, any causal operation, any realm breakthrough, must all trail-mark in the Alaya Network, be anchor-calibrated, pass Symbiotic Court approval. This entry takes the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> as core, giving the institutional design to &quot;stamp out combat-power inflation.&quot;</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-harm-of-no-supervision" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Harm of No Supervision) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-harm-of-no-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Harm of No Supervision)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consequences of Dragon Ball world without Alaya supervision:</p><ul><li><strong>Energy changes not trail-marked</strong>: every Goku breakthrough, no one records &quot;why broke through, what was the breakthrough cost&quot;</li><li><strong>Causal operations unapproved</strong>: Dragon Ball wishing revives people, restores cities; no one approves &quot;does this revival disrupt causality&quot;</li><li><strong>Realm breakthroughs uncalibrated</strong>: SSJ1/2/3/God/Blue/Ultra Instinct, every breakthrough no anchor calibration; readers cannot judge &quot;how strong is it now&quot;</li><li><strong>Conclusion</strong>: energy growth without supervision = numerical inflation + causal collapse + setting self-consistency zeroed</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-harm-of-no-supervision" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Harm of No Supervision) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-harm-of-no-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Harm of No Supervision)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How no Alaya supervision feeds historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Knowledge not accumulated</strong>: because energy changes not trail-marked, early &quot;cultivation experience&quot; may be invalidated late</li><li><strong>Causality arbitrarily modified</strong>: revival, restoration, wishing, no trail-mark; civilization has no true history</li><li><strong>Strong ones unaccountable</strong>: God of Destruction smashes planets, Zeno wipes universes; no supervision, no accountability</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-harm-of-no-supervision" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Harm of No Supervision) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-harm-of-no-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Harm of No Supervision)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s predatory thinking under no-supervision system:</p><ul><li><strong>Breakthrough unapproved</strong>: every Goku temporary transformation, no one approves &quot;does this breakthrough conform to law&quot;</li><li><strong>Wishing un-trailed</strong>: Goku&#39;s party repeatedly gathers Dragon Balls to &quot;revive companions&quot;; no one trails &quot;how much causality this revival disrupted&quot;</li><li><strong>Training resources unaudited</strong>: Whis sparring with Goku; no one audits &quot;is this cosmos-tier mentor resource fairly distributed&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-alaya-supervision-design" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Alaya Supervision Design) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-alaya-supervision-design" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Alaya Supervision Design)&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball No Supervision</th><th>Alaya Supervision Plan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Energy changes not trail-marked</td><td>Alaya Network records every energy change: who broke through, why, what cost</td></tr><tr><td>Causal operations unapproved</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom: cross-plane operations strictly filed; observe first then limited interference</td></tr><tr><td>Realm breakthroughs uncalibrated</td><td>Anchor calibration (Doc 027): periodically calibrate energy definitions; prevent narrative devaluation</td></tr><tr><td>Revival un-trailed</td><td>Revival goes Symbiotic Court approval: who revives, why, what cost; whole process trailed</td></tr><tr><td>Strong ones unaccountable</td><td>Anchor Inspection Committee: supervise all cosmos-tier strong ones, including God of Destruction/Angels/Zeno</td></tr><tr><td>Training resources unaudited</td><td>Cross-plane mentor resources go Alaya audit; distribution transparent</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball world; inject Alaya supervision network</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: stage injection — stage 1 energy trail-marking, stage 2 causal approval, stage 3 strong-one accountability</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count combat-power inflation rate, causal disruption times, strong-one abuse-of-power times</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Alaya Supervision Injecting Dragon Ball World Benefit Report</em>, quantifying supervision system&#39;s effect on stamping out combat-power inflation</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Self-consistency before injection: 2/10</strong> (no supervision = numerical inflation + causal collapse)</li><li><strong>Expected self-consistency after injection: 9/10</strong> (Alaya trail-marking + anchor calibration + Symbiotic Court approval)</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: from extremely high to low — any setting modification must go through Alaya trail-marking, anchor calibration; &quot;give way for plot&quot; not allowed</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: from high to low (network)</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: energy changes trail-marked; early cultivation experience not invalidated late</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: strong ones supervised, training resources audited, wishing approved</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least had no numerical inflation; Dragon Ball needs Alaya to stamp out inflation</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Alaya Network covers Myriad Ranks 99%; any race&#39;s cultivator fairly promotes under supervision</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Alaya Network is multiverse-tier infrastructure; can infinitely expand without collapse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya supervision is not to &quot;over-regulate&quot; cultivation, but to let cultivation &quot;be traceable.&quot; Dragon Ball&#39;s combat-power inflation is essentially running wild without a brake — the Alaya Network is that brake. It does not prevent Goku from getting strong; it only makes Goku every time he gets strong trail-mark, calibrate, be supervised by Myriad Ranks. Let numerical inflation become linear growth, let causal disruption become approval-controllable, let strong-one abuse of power become accountable — this is Alaya supervision&#39;s institutional value to Dragon Ball world.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · Alaya supervision plan · institutional design to stamp out combat-power inflation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./455_模块2-龙珠-制度替代收益-锚点共生注入龙珠世界.html">Entry 455 · Institutional-Alternative Benefits</a> · <a href="./457_模块2-龙珠-万族共和方案-打破人族赛亚人本位.html">Entry 457 · Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const p=i(n,[["render",r]]);export{d as __pageData,p as default};
